    </section>
    <section id="history">
        <h2>Our History</h2>
        <p>Founded in 2020, NutritionProject started as a small startup with a big vision. Over the years, we have grown into a leading provider of total daily energy expanditure calculating calculators, serving clients worldwide. Our journey has been marked by milestones and achievements, fueled by our passion for innovation and dedication to customer success. As we look to the future, we remain committed to pushing boundaries, expanding our offerings, and delivering value to our clients and partners.</p>
    </section>
    <section id="community">
        <h2>Community Engagement</h2>
        <p>At NutritionProject, we believe in giving back to the communities we serve. We are committed to making a positive impact through various initiatives, including volunteering, charitable donations, and community outreach programs. By actively engaging with our local communities, we aim to create meaningful change and contribute to the common good.</p>
    </section>
